// The Storage domain of the client binding: the client's own file layer, as wxl.storage drives it.
//
// Row shapes: see binding.def, which documents them. A path is the client's own:
// backslash-separated, case-insensitive, relative to the data root. A `file` is whatever the
// client's open handed back, opaque to everything above; it is closed with file_close and
// nothing else may be done with it.
